# Stage 18a — Versioned release (GATE)

Read `references/release_versioning.md`.

Call `create_release`. It refuses unless the latest random spot-check validation
PASSed, then writes (for public_domain/licensed) `output/release/{title}_vX.X.X.epub`,
`release_notes.md`, `release_state.json`, `release_index.md` — or, for
`private_use`, the equivalents under `output/private_artifacts/`.

After it succeeds, open the produced release notes and ensure the top (newest)
entry records: reason, issues, fixes, QA evidence (spot-check round,
release_confidence, EPUBCheck, publication lint), risks, and next iteration.

Exit condition: versioned artifact + notes + state.json (latest_status==PASS) exist;
stop for controller validation and commit.
